AmbientRing -- an option used to tell divisor construction that a particular ambient ring is expected.
******************************************************************************************************

Description
===========

If set to a ring, then when calling divisor, the primes are all checked whether
they are ideals in that ring.

Functions with optional argument named AmbientRing:
===================================================

  * "divisor(...,AmbientRing=>...)" -- see *note divisor: divisor, --
    constructor for (Weil/Q/R)-divisors

