coefficient(Ideal,BasicDivisor) -- get the coefficient of an ideal for a fixed divisor
**************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note coefficient: (Macaulay2Doc)coefficient,
  * Usage: 
        coefficient(P, D)
  * Inputs:
      * P, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, the height one prime ideal
