      * D, an instance of the type *note BasicDivisor: BasicDivisor,, the
        divisor in question
  * Outputs:
      * a *note number: (Macaulay2Doc)Number,, 

Description
===========

This function returns the coefficient of $D$ along the prime divisor associated
to $P$.

+----------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,u,v]/ideal(x*y-u*v);    |
