coefficients(BasicDivisor) -- get the list of coefficients of a divisor
***********************************************************************

  * Function: *note coefficients: (Macaulay2Doc)coefficients,
  * Usage: 
        coefficients( D1 )
  * Inputs:
      * D1, an instance of the type *note BasicDivisor: BasicDivisor,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Monomials: (Macaulay2Doc)coefficients, => ..., default value
        null,
      * *note Variables: (Macaulay2Doc)coefficients, => ..., default value
        null,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

Get the list of coefficients of a BasicDivisor (or a WeilDivisor, QWeilDivisor
or RWeilDivisor).

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,u,v]/ideal(x*y-u*v);                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : D = divisor(x);                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : WeilDivisor on R                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
