+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : E = divisor(x*u);                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : WeilDivisor on R                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : coefficients(E)                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = {1, 1, 2}                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : F = divisor({0, 1/2, -2/3}, {ideal(y, u), ideal(x,u), ideal(x,v)},      |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = 0*Div(y, u) + 1/2*Div(x, u) + -2/3*Div(x, v)                            |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : QWeilDivisor on R                                                       |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|CoefficientType => QQ)                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : coefficients(F)                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|         1    2                                                              |
|o7 = {0, -, - -}                                                             |
|         2    3                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : G = divisor({0.5, -0.667}, {ideal(x,u), ideal(x,v)}, CoefficientType => |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = .5*Div(x, u) + -.667*Div(x, v)                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : RWeilDivisor on R                                                       |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|RR)                                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : coefficients(G)                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = {.5, -.667}                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

