ideals -- a symbol used as a key within the divisor cache
*********************************************************

Description
===========

Each divisor has a cache (a CacheTable).  One of the keys of this cache is
always (symbol ideals).  This points to a MutableHashTable whose keys are lists
of elements in a Groebner basis and which themselves point to how the ideal
should be displayed.  Note the trim command trims these ideals.

