|i3 : isVeryAmple(D)                         |
|                                            |
|o3 = false                                  |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i4 : isVeryAmple(2*D)                       |
|                                            |
|o4 = false                                  |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i5 : isVeryAmple(3*D)                       |
|                                            |
|o5 = true                                   |
+--------------------------------------------+

The output value of this function is stored in the divisor's cache.

