Check if a rational/real divisor is a Weil divisor

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x, y, z];                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : D1 = divisor({1/1, 2/2, -6/3}, {ideal(x), ideal(y), ideal(z)},          |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = Div(y) + -2*Div(z) + Div(x)                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : QWeilDivisor on R                                                       |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|CoefficientType=>QQ)                                                         |
