Number * BasicDivisor -- multiply a divisor by a number
*******************************************************

  * Operator: *note *: (Macaulay2Doc)_st,
  * Usage: 
        n * D
  * Inputs:
      * n, a *note number: (Macaulay2Doc)Number,, 
      * D, an instance of the type *note BasicDivisor: BasicDivisor,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note BasicDivisor: BasicDivisor,, 

Description
===========

Multiply a divisor by an integer or a real or rational number.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y];                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : D = divisor(x^2*y/(x+y));                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : WeilDivisor on R                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : E = divisor({1/2, -5/3}, {ideal(x), ideal(y)}, CoefficientType=>QQ)     |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = 1/2*Div(x) + -5/3*Div(y)                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : QWeilDivisor on R                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : F = divisor({1.5, 0, -3.2}, {ideal(x), ideal(y), ideal(x^2-y^3)},       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = -3.2*Div(-y^3+x^2) + 1.5*Div(x) + 0*Div(y)                              |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : RWeilDivisor on R                                                       |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|CoefficientType=>RR)                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : 8*D                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = -8*Div(x+y) + 16*Div(x) + 8*Div(y)                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : WeilDivisor on R                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : (-2/3)*D                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = 2/3*Div(x+y) + -4/3*Div(x) + -2/3*Div(y)                                |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : QWeilDivisor on R                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : 0.0*D                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = 0, the zero divisor                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : RWeilDivisor on R                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : (3/2)*E                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = 3/4*Div(x) + -5/2*Div(y)                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : QWeilDivisor on R                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : (-1.414)*E                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = 2.35667*Div(y) + -.707*Div(x)                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : RWeilDivisor on R                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : 6*F                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o10 = -19.2*Div(-y^3+x^2) + 9*Div(x)                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o10 : RWeilDivisor on R                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : (-3/2)*F                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o11 = 4.8*Div(-y^3+x^2) + -2.25*Div(x)                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o11 : RWeilDivisor on R                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

