positivePart -- get the effective part or anti-effective part of a divisor
**************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        positivePart( F1 )
        negativePart( F1 )
  * Inputs:
      * F1, an instance of the type *note RWeilDivisor: BasicDivisor,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note RWeilDivisor: BasicDivisor,, an effective
        divisor

Description
===========

This function returns the positive part of a divisor

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x, y, u, v] / ideal(x * y - u * v);                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : D = divisor({1, -2, 3, -4}, {ideal(x, u), ideal(y, u), ideal(x, v),     |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = -4*Div(y, v) + Div(x, u) + -2*Div(y, u) + 3*Div(x, v)                   |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : WeilDivisor on R                                                        |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|ideal(y, v)})                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : positivePart( D )                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = Div(x, u) + 3*Div(x, v)                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : WeilDivisor on R                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : negativePart( D )                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = 2*Div(y, u) + 4*Div(y, v)                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : WeilDivisor on R                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : D == positivePart(D) - negativePart(D)                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : E = divisor({0, 1}, {ideal(x,u), ideal(y,u)})                           |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = 0*Div(x, u) + Div(y, u)                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : WeilDivisor on R                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : positivePart(E)                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = Div(y, u)                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : WeilDivisor on R                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : negativePart(E)                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = 0, the zero divisor                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : WeilDivisor on R                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : E == positivePart(E) - negativePart(E)                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

