primes -- get the list of height-one primes in the support of a divisor
***********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        primes( D1 )
  * Inputs:
      * D1, an instance of the type *note BasicDivisor: BasicDivisor,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

This function returns the list of height-one prime ideals corresponding to the
components of a BasicDivisor.  Note that if you don't call cleanSupport, this
can return primes with coefficient equal to zero.

+-----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,u,v]/ideal(x*y-u*v);           |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : D = divisor(x)                            |
|                                               |
|o2 = Div(v, x) + Div(u, x)                     |
|                                               |
|o2 : WeilDivisor on R                          |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i3 : primes(D)                                 |
|                                               |
|o3 = {ideal (v, x), ideal (u, x)}              |
|                                               |
|o3 : List                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i4 : E = divisor(x*u)                          |
|                                               |
|o4 = Div(v, x) + Div(u, y) + 2*Div(u, x)       |
|                                               |
|o4 : WeilDivisor on R                          |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i5 : primes(E)                                 |
|                                               |
|o5 = {ideal (v, x), ideal (u, y), ideal (u, x)}|
|                                               |
|o5 : List                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i6 : F = divisor({0}, {ideal(x,u)})            |
|                                               |
|o6 = 0*Div(x, u)                               |
|                                               |
|o6 : WeilDivisor on R                          |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i7 : primes(F)                                 |
|                                               |
|o7 = {ideal (x, u)}                            |
|                                               |
|o7 : List                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i8 : primes(cleanSupport F)                    |
|                                               |
|o8 = {}                                        |
|                                               |
|o8 : List                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i9 : primes(1*F)                               |
|                                               |
|o9 = {}                                        |
|                                               |
|o9 : List                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------+

See also
========

